{
  "bookId": "hero-213016",
  "id": "bond-27549",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27549001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "你回来了？不好意思，刚刚在做扒带练习。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27549002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我是不是打扰到你了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27549003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "怎么会，是我练习太投入了，忘记了时间。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27549004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "虽然快到演出日了，但适当地休息也是很有必要的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27549005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "谢谢你的关心~我会注意的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27549006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "我只是，不想让粉丝感到失望。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27549007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "只有不断地努力，才能在演出中给大家带来快乐和惊喜！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27549008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这样的话，你会很辛苦吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27549009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "哈哈，我还有一起努力的伙伴们啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27549010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "只要大家在一起，哪怕是通宵排练，也是非常幸福的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27549011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "用音乐传递快乐，这就是我们最想做的事！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27549012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "所以，演出日那天，你会来现场为我们加油吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27549013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "当然，我期待很久了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27549014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "嗯哼~太好了！这是我专门为你预留的VIP观众席的门票！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27549015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "演出日，不见不散哦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
